  "prefLabel": "Rev 1601.11 Paid calling service",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rev 1601.11 “Paid calling service” means “paid calling service” as defined in RSA 82-A:2, XXIII, and includes prepaid phone calls.\n\nSource. #4799, Interim, eff 8-22-90, exp. 6-1-90; ss by #4954, eff 10-16-90; ss by #6336, eff 9-24-96; ss and moved by #8178, eff 9-24-04 (from Rev 1601.10); ss by #10213, eff 10-24-12 (from Rev 1601.09); ss by #13553, eff 2-7-23 (formerly Rev 1601.10) (see Revision Note at chapter heading for Rev 1600)",
